Pharmacy Association (ISPPA), London, United Kingdom.

1. Open-Science Research Scope (Non-Commercial Public-Good Science)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository, benchmark suite (`OpenCYP-FTQC v1.0`), active-space `FCIDUMP`
Hamiltonian collection, and accompanying 18-page monograph (`Quantum-LTC`) are
released strictly in the name of open, reproducible, non-commercial scientific
research and clinical safety methodology.

2. Source Code & Original Datasets
----------------------------------
- **Original Software & Benchmark Scripts (`src/`, `experiments/`, `models/`,
  `scripts/`, `tests/`):** Licensed under the **Apache License, Version 2.0**
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
- **Monograph, Figures, Active-Space `FCIDUMP` Integrals & Knowledge Graph
  (`Quantum_LTC_Roadmap.pdf`, `opencyp_ftqc/`, `results/`):** Licensed under the
  **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), subject to the upstream
  database and model terms listed in Section 3 below.

3. Mandatory Upstream Scientific Program & Database Terms
---------------------------------------------------------
Users reusing or redistributing derived artifacts must respect the following
upstream terms:

- **Google Antigravity for Scientific Workflows:** Supported in part by
  complimentary access to Google Antigravity and Gemini 4 Argon for
  non-commercial scientific research conducted under public clinical /
  non-profit research affiliation.
- **AlphaGenome 2 & AlphaGenome Atlas (`v2.dna_client` & AVI Scores):**
  Regulatory variant predictions (`CYP3A4*22` rs35599367, `ACE` rs4343, `SLC5A2`
  rs9934336, `MUC5B` rs35705950) are non-commercial research-use-only outputs
  subject to the **AlphaGenome Non-Commercial Terms**
  (https://deepmind.google.com/science/alphagenome/terms) and are not validated
  for clinical diagnosis or prescribing.
- **EMBL-EBI ChEMBL (`ChEMBL_37`, `CHEMBL340` / `CHEMBL289` / `CHEMBL3397`):**
  Experimental bioactivity data (`Ki`, `IC50`, `Km`) are derived from the ChEMBL
  Database and licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
  Unported (CC BY-SA 3.0)**
  (https://chembl.gitbook.io/chembl-interface-documentation/about).
- **RCSB Protein Data Bank (`PDB 5TE8`, `3NXU`, `1TQN`, `4WNU`, `1R9O`, `1O86`,
  `1N9V`):** Experimental 3D macromolecular coordinates are distributed under
  the **CC0 1.0 Public Domain Dedication**
  (https://www.rcsb.org/pages/usage-policy).
- **EMBL-EBI Ontology Lookup Service (`OLS4`, Human Disease Ontology `DOID`):**
  Distributed under **CC0 1.0**.

4. Statutory Clinical Safety Disclaimer (NHS DCB0129 & DCB0160)
---------------------------------------------------------------
This software and dataset constitute an exploratory computational research
sandbox (`0` physical QPU shots, `0` human wet-lab specimens, `phi_present =
False`). All six clinical hazards (`H-LTC-01` through `H-LTC-06`) remain
strictly `OPEN`. Nothing in this repository is certified as a medical device
(UKCA / CE SaMD) or intended for autonomous patient diagnosis, triage, or
prescribing without qualified clinician and Pharmacist Structured Medication
Review (SMR) oversight.
